flowchart LR
    Q[User Question] --> OV{Overview-shaped?<br/>"how are we doing today"}
    OV -- yes --> SNAP[Read DomainStateSnapshot<br/>cron-resolved, not recomputed]
    SNAP --> R
    OV -- no --> PLAN[Coordinator Plan]

    PLAN --> OBS[Observe]
    OBS --> BS[(Business State Service<br/>get_metric_state)]
    OBS --> ANOM{Anomaly needed?}
    ANOM -- yes --> A[Anomaly]
    A --> BS
    ANOM -- no --> DIAG
    A --> DIAG{Diagnosis needed?}
    DIAG -- yes --> D[Diagnostic]
    DIAG -- no --> PRED
    D --> H{Domain frontier changed?}
    H -- yes --> X[Leadership Transfer]
    X --> D
    H -- no --> PRED{Prediction needed?}
    PRED -- yes --> P[Prediction]
    P --> BS
    PRED -- no --> STRAT
    P --> STRAT{Strategy needed?}
    STRAT -- yes --> S[Strategy]
    STRAT -- no --> SK[Skeptic / Claim Gate]
    S --> SK
    SK --> V{Pass?}
    V -- revise --> OBS
    V -- pass --> R[Verified Response]
